WEBVTT

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:36.350
Today's story is about Neji and
his cousin, Hinata Hyuga.

00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:42.330
Why are you following me?

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.020
Why not?

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.830
You're going to supervise 
Hinata's training, right?

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:48.720
If we're talking Hyugas, 
then we're talking Gentle Fist!

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.330
Please let me come along and observe!

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:51.980
Observe what?

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.910
Naruto!

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:57.510
We're―

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:02.070
It's nothing.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.230
Also, Sakura was looking for you.

00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:05.850
She was?

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:07.660
What could she want?

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.810
What was that for, Neji?!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.650
He butts into other people's 
business too much.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.890
And to be honest, it would
interfere if he came.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.570
You don't have to be so mean about it.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.200
He's the main character of 
Naruto Shippuuden, remember?

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.010
Look, I didn't have a choice.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.380
This is the one time 
he'll be a real hindrance.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.010
<b>Hinata is Neji's Cousin</b>

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:43.470
<b>Hyuga</b>

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:43.470
Since Hinata likes Naruto, 
she'd faint if she caught a glimpse of him.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:47.050
And then our plans for training 
would go down the drain.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.720
That goes for all of you, 
please don't intrude on―

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.190
What was that?

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:53.650
N-Nejis!

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.260
Nejis everywhere!

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.560
My apologies.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:03.210
Of course they look like Neji. 
They're all related!

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.870
No, not this much.

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.580
Even for family, 
they look way too similar!

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:08.620
Agreed.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.920
You two look way too similar, 
and you're not related at all!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:17.800
Oh, Hinata has already started.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:23.260
What?

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.460
Hinata, you're just like me,

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:28.040
working hard whenever 
you have a spare moment!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.100
A hard worker with the same
hairstyle as us. How wonderful!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.320
It's like we've known each 
other our whole lives!

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.730
Stop it! You're gonna make her cry!

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.840
E-Eight Trigrams Defense,
Sixty-four Palms!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.340
Lady Hinata!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:53.840
She's in shock from being 
associated with those two...

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.480
Interfere with training again
 and I'll throw you out!

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.300
Okay...

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:04.330
That attack was Hinata's 
ultimate defense,

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:06.560
The Eight Trigrams Defense,
Sixty-four Palms.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.500
It definitely reminds 
me of your moves, Neji.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:14.260
The Gentle Fist and Byakugan have
been in the Hyuga clan for generations.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:17.280
Even today, many ninja endeavor 
to steal their secrets.

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.410
Hinata is next in line to lead the clan,

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:24.600
but was born with no talent as a ninja.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.330
That's why she trains 
diligently every day.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.450
Right...

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:33.330
But why are you so 
protective of her, Neji?

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.650
You used to hate her.

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:41.680
I...

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:47.380
I did and said terrible 
things to Hinata.

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:51.970
I can never atone for those sins,

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.980
but I at least want to protect 
her and help her however I can.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:57.460
That's how it is.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:01.610
Neji, if you want, 
we'll be happy to help.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.550
We're partially to blame 
for what just happened.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.360
Guys...

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:09.200
How about you let us lend a hand, too?

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.120
Shino, Kiba!

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.810
Ah, these two are on the 
same team as Hinata and—

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:21.220
Well, they're pretty minor 
characters, so that's about it.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.000
The heck?!

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:24.780
You can count me in, too.

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:25.820
Naruto?!

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.220
Apparently Sakura wasn't looking for me—

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.380
Eight Trigrams Air Palm!

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.180
Why?!

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:38.300
All right, let's start training.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.280
S-Six versus one?

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.110
Oh, of course not.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.820
We just want to help out however we can.

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:48.160
Let me give you a little 
advice to start off.

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:51.320
Guy-sensei is a hand-to-hand 
combat specialist.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.140
I'm sure he's got something useful to—

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:56.000
You should wear these 
tights while you train!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.740
They'll bring you one step 
closer to being like me.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:03.630
If Hinata puts those on...

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.050
<i>What do you think, Neji?</i>

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.090
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:11.800
My tights!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.690
Moving on.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:15.770
You're up, Kiba.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:17.860
What's wrong?

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.270
Akamaru needs to pee.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:22.650
Don't do it in the 
courtyard, go outside!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:26.900
But Akamaru's gotta go bad.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:27.720
Over here!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.460
Lady Hinata!

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.780
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.420
Akamaru!

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:46.200
How can I fix this...

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.380
Don't worry.

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:52.730
I, Shino Aburame, and my Destruction Bugs 
will aid Hinata's training efforts.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:54.810
Ah, thank you, Shino!

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:58.810
Hinata!

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.870
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:01.980
That move's so useful!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.300
A-A-Akamaru...

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:05.360
Buggy... Bugster... Bugtholemew!

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:05.980
Wow.

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:09.560
He's already in standby 
for the next punchline!

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:11.680
The Eight Trigrams,
Sixty-four Punchlines...

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.740
That attack is why the Hyugas 
are such renowned comedians.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.830
I've never heard that.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.240
Set me up, I dare you.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.290
You are within...

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.280
...the range of my punchline!

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:25.750
You're rolling with it, too?!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.160
You guys are hopeless. 
Let me handle this.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.410
We have to start by addressing 
Hinata's weak point.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:35.100
Wow, he's actually serious for once!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:39.700
Perhaps. Lady Hinata and Lee do 
have similar hairstyles―

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.550
I mean, dedication to training.

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:43.310
Maybe I should let him handle it.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:45.770
My Naruto Defense class...

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:47.610
...is ready!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:48.690
What's up?

00:07:57.870 --> 00:07:59.820
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Strikes!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.380
What's wrong with you?!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:05.830
Lady Hinata?!

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.490
L-Lady Hinata...

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.300
Lady Hinata!

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.980
Freeze, you!

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:21.100
What's the big idea, Neji―

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.110
Beat it!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:25.190
<b>Hyuga</b>

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:23.870
Eight Trigrams Air Palm!

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:29.650
We were smart to observe them first.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:34.740
I've got a plan to take the 
Hyugas' powers for our own.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.250
Naruto!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.580
Is he training with 
his shadow clones?

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.780
Gotcha.

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:53.240
Who are you?

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:55.550
And why are you dressed like Naruto?

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.850
Our plan to lure out 
Hinata Hyuga worked!

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:02.400
You're coming with us.
We're gonna steal your power!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.100
What?!

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:08.060
How could I have missed 
those rogue ninjas?

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:10.520
Wait for us, Neji!

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:11.900
I'm going on ahead!

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.800
I would say you're pretty good,

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:22.620
but you're mine now, believe that!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.650
That?

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.460
I hear everyone hates the Hyugas.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:32.590
No one's gonna save you now!

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:39.970
Neji...

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:42.390
I'm sorry, Hinata.

00:09:42.780 --> 00:09:45.360
I can't apologize enough.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.310
If it's about the training, don't worry...

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.380
It's not just that.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.680
I once forgot what was really important,

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.300
and did some awful things...

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.200
What're you mumbling about over there?

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.420
Lady Hinata...

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.740
We should combine our powers 
to help one another,

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:06.380
as fellow clansmen!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.170
Neji...

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.150
We can do it.

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:15.550
If we attack together, 
we can take all of them out!

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.530
Right!

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:18.270
Don't forget us!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.140
M-More fake Narutos...

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:30.990
We're taking the Byakugan.
You can't stop us!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.520
Not on my watch!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:35.130
This is getting complicated.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:36.490
But this is our chance...

00:10:37.020 --> 00:10:39.380
Hinata, you're on defense!

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:39.970
Okay!

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:41.660
Eight Trigrams Rotation!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.870
Eight Trigrams Defense,
Sixty-four Palms!

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.810
Eight Trigrams Infinite Whirl!

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:49.790
Wow...

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.140
We did it, Lady Hinata.

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:55.250
Yes, but I still need to keep working!

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.760
Someday, I want everyone to 
acknowledge my strength.

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:01.050
Neji!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.890
I finally found you, ya jerk!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.070
You got a problem with me?

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:10.160
T-T-T-The real Naruto...

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.080
Huh?

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:21.240
Naruto, why must you 
have such bad timing?!

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.990
Wait! I didn't do anything―

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.570
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Palms!

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.490
The heck?!

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:32.750
And so Naruto is sent 
blasting off again.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:43.550
Everyone has some kind of weakness,

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.830
and overcoming them is never easy.

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:48.430
Your footwork is too relaxed!

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:54.400
You need to be more offensive, Lady Hinata.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.590
Nothing will happen
 if all you do is block!

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.900
R-Right!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:02.170
Lady Hinata!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.780
Oh, please no...

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:08.810
Hey, I thought you were sparring.
This is no time to lie down, Hinata!

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:09.950
Don't quit now.

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:15.010
Again... It's your fault!

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:17.380
Whoa, w-w-what's my fault?!

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:23.410
I don't blame Neji for 
being fed up with me.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.830
I'm pathetic.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.420
My skills are bad enough,

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.280
and with such a big weakness on top of it...

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.440
Aw, don't be sad.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:34.770
Yeah, all you need to do 
is overcome your weakness.

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.530
Overcome it?

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:38.730
But how?

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:42.920
Well, if you could hang 
out around Naruto 24/7,

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.960
you'll have to get used to it eventually.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.530
That's it, Tenten!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.300
We just need to create scenarios where
Hinata ends up next to Naruto!

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:52.660
Huh? What're you talking about?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.420
I'll call it "Dating to Fix the Fainting!"

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.410
If Hinata and Naruto start going out,

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:00.860
they'll always be together!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:03.920
There's no way she won't get used to
being around Naruto at some point!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.410
I like it!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.800
That'll fix Hinata's weakness in no time,

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.310
and dating her hero would kill 
two birds with one stone!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.860
Wait, we're getting ahead of ourselves.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.240
That may be just the 
drastic measure I need.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.030
I must go on the offensive.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:22.650
Hinata...

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.650
All right!

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.400
Rock Lee, the Master of Love,

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.870
will do everything he 
can to aid your quest!

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:31.370
Master of Love?

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:41.380
<b>Hinata's Weak Point is Naruto</b>

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.840
So, Lee...

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:47.080
When exactly did you become 
the "Master of Love?"

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.750
Have you forgotten, Tenten?

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:52.350
The way I passionately pursued Sakura,

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.060
and the bittersweet days 
of my youth that resulted?

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.220
I remember she flat-out turned you down.

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:01.230
It was less bittersweet 
and more complete defeat.

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:02.880
Still!

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.110
Failure breeds success!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:08.260
Be casually kind,

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.240
make him happy with presents,

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.020
be open and honest about your feelings,

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:13.690
and get a little forceful 
every now and then.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:15.450
Follow these four principles,

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:17.370
and next time,

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.440
your target will fall for you!

00:14:22.690 --> 00:14:23.650
Wow...

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:25.330
Why the Primary Lotus?!

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.900
He didn't just fall,

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:29.530
he got dropped on his head!

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:32.270
Did you just laugh?

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:37.890
Think I'll have a bite...

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:38.890
U-Um...

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.090
What's up, Hinata?

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.860
Who's that?

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:46.440
Don't mind me, I'm just a stage hand.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.120
Okay...

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.340
Remember, Hinata, rule one:

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:51.700
Casual kindness!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:52.410
Right!

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:54.200
Um...

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.410
I just happened to have this on me!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.860
Whoa, you're awesome Hinata!

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:00.120
Nice timing!

00:15:01.510 --> 00:15:02.950
Looking good!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:04.280
Time for rule two.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:05.510
Presents! Go!

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:07.890
Also, um...

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:10.480
It's not healthy to only 
eat cup ramen, so...

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:12.300
So?

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.970
Hold on, Naruto.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.200
I'll get it!

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.740
My eye, my eye!

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:21.520
Oh, no!

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.020
This time!

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:27.280
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:31.240
I've got a pretty good idea of 
what's happening up there...

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:33.760
Wh-What do I do now?

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:35.370
We've gotta go with the last two!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.950
Be open and honest and 
go in for the kiss!

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:39.460
Kiss?!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.330
What are you thinking?!

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:43.540
Naruto's panicking right now.

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:46.200
The only thing that ever calms 
an out-of-control heroine....

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.450
...is a sudden kiss from 
the main character!

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:49.800
It's common knowledge.

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.540
In movies and stuff.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.950
He's no heroine and she's 
no main character,

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.510
and why are you swooning?!

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:57.870
Go on, Hinata!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:58.470
Go on!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:15:59.880
Go on!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.960
K-K-K-Kiss?

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:02.940
Me?

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.360
K-Ki-

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:08.320
She overheated!

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.830
That weakness is a real problem...

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:20.270
Lady Hinata?!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.470
W-What the...

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:30.610
I'm sorry. You were doing 
so much to help.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:33.260
No, I'm sorry for being so useless.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.390
Easy, easy.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.910
It's no good.

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:39.720
I want to change, so I went 
on the offensive, but...

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.090
Offensive?

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:42.830
Of course, that's it!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:43.560
Tenten?

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:46.560
Sakura is more Naruto's type, right?

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.300
Wait, hear me out.

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:54.700
Sakura's got a very forceful, 
confident personality.

00:16:54.700 --> 00:17:00.660
<b>Naruto &
Sakura</b>

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.520
In comedy terms, she always 
nails the punchline.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.930
And Naruto's the perfect setup man!

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:00.660
Meaning what?

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:03.830
People are drawn to people who 
compliment their personality.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:08.880
If you can get him in a situation 
where he sets you up...

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:13.880
<b>Naruto &
Hinata</b>

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:10.720
What the heck?

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.280
That was some punchline, Hinata!

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.590
You'll have another shot at 
overcoming your weakness!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:20.220
Me? Do a punchline?

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:23.350
I'd like to help, too.

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:26.060
Neji?

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.190
We're working on that 
one weak point, right?

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:30.040
There you go, Hinata.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.720
Welcome to the world
of reaction comedy!

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.010
Is this a good idea?

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:39.620
She's... not really the type.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.290
Hinata's fine the way she is.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:46.360
Don't be a wet blanket.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:47.540
What do you think?

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:52.780
The Hyuga clan has long practiced
the art of delivering punchlines.

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:53.800
They do?

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.490
I'll do it!

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:01.220
<b>Tashi & Toka</b>

00:17:56.970 --> 00:18:01.220
When
we
get
back
10

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:01.220
This book will teach you 
jokes for any situation.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:02.770
"The Fire Country?!"

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:04.970
That little phrase is an old favorite.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.140
Tenten, you're into comedy?!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.520
Ready when you are.

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:12.650
Here goes.

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:14.610
The fire nation?!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.070
The fire station!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.230
A counter-punchline!

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.780
He hit back with twice 
the force of her line.

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:23.100
So that's Neji's comedic power!

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.660
Your delivery's too relaxed!

00:18:25.190 --> 00:18:28.470
You'll never master true 
comedy with that attitude.

00:18:28.470 --> 00:18:29.310
There it is!

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:31.170
The Eight Trigrams, Sixty-four Punchlines!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:33.250
She's within the range of his punchline!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.510
Too weak!

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:35.230
Not a peep!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.500
Are you going to attack or go to sleep?

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:38.800
I can do it...

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.910
I'll nail the punchline,

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.340
then I'll nail Naruto's heart 
with Cupid's arrow!

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:46.270
Heart?

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.840
Yeah, that's what this is all about.

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:52.270
Our plan is for them to start dating.
That way she'll stop fainting!

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:57.240
Neji came in late, so he had no idea.

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.140
What are you talking about?!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.660
Forget comedy, dating 
is out of the question!

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.660
No way!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.120
Neji is using his best bits!

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.750
You can work on something else!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:12.080
Ecology, biology, chiropractic medicine!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:14.120
He's relentless!

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.460
She's going to get overwhelmed.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.920
Hinata, just react!
 It doesn't matter what you say!

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.840
It sounds easy, but...

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:23.810
Never.

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:26.850
You and Naruto...
doing things like that...

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:39.230
It's...

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.700
...an infamy!

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:42.160
Quit daydreaming!

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:44.540
Lady Hinata...

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.870
What a perfect reaction...

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:49.540
Yes!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.710
<b>Sea Cucumber</b>

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.710
<b>& Crab Miso</b>

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.040
So good...

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.580
The crab miso and sea cucumber 
are in perfect balance.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:02.720
This is some rich flavor 
they came up with...

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:03.800
You're not rich!

00:20:06.710 --> 00:20:08.370
<i>I can't do it...</i>

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.770
<i>It's no good!</i>

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.880
What's up? You come to 
swat another bug off me?

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:20.190
There's a lot of things 
I don't get about you,

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:23.910
but I'm never surprised 
to see you acting nice.

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:26.530
I like that about you.

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.920
<i>She's... not really the type.</i>

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:35.710
<i>Hinata's fine the way she is.</i>

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:42.030
This thing's leaking something...

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:44.170
It's a stink bug!

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:47.030
Gross!

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:52.620
You're really stopping? 
After all that effort?

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:57.330
I don't think I have it in me 
to whack Naruto for comedy.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:59.530
You are who you are, Hinata.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:03.030
So in the end we didn't 
make any progress.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.860
That's not true at all.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.300
I feel like today I managed to keep...

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:09.160
...myself together around
Naruto for longer than usual,

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.450
and as long as I have time 
to mentally prepare...

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:14.460
Hey, Hinata, I forgot to 
give this back to you.

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:18.500
Hinata!

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.640
It all goes to waste when 
you pop in out of nowhere,

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:21.550
you idiot!

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:22.950
Huh?

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:24.480
What'd I do?

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:29.160
After enduring a long struggle,

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:32.980
Hinata managed to make a little bit 
of progress on her weak point.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:34.350
The fire nation?

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.390
No...

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:36.600
Th-The fire nation?!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:40.040
Elsewhere, having been defeated 
by Hinata's punchline,

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:43.110
Neji goes back to basic training.

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.320
I'm just in the summary?!

00:23:21.590 --> 00:23:23.450
I didn't get one good scene this week,

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:25.750
so I'm at least gonna nail the preview.

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:27.230
Um, Naruto, about this episode—

00:23:27.230 --> 00:23:29.240
Oh, you here to watch 
me kill it, Hinata?

00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:29.690
No, I—

00:23:29.690 --> 00:23:31.340
Next week is "Teamwhoa—"

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:33.000
Hinata is the star this week.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:34.030
Take a hike!

00:23:34.030 --> 00:23:36.030
Please read the preview, Hinata.

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:37.600
Naruto, I'm sorry!

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:40.940
Next week is "Teamwork
Symbolizes Youth,"

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:43.310
<b>Teamwork Symbolizes Youth
The Culprit is Among Us!</b>

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.310
and "The Culprit is Among Us."

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:47.940
Why is the hero of the main 
series relegated to bit parts?
